flowchart LR
  PBI[Read-only PBIP/TMDL] --> INV[Deterministic inventory and support classification]
  SF[Imported Snowflake YAML evidence] --> CMP[Comparison and semantic lint]
  INV --> CMP
  CAN[Canonical dbt contract / benchmark reference] --> IR[Typed semantic IR]
  IR --> CMP
  CMP --> REVIEW[Explicit human review boundary]
  REVIEW --> CAND[Governed Power BI and Snowflake candidates]
  CAND --> EQ[Independent equivalence evidence]
  EQ --> READY[Ready for governed finalization]
  READY -. no deployment .-> STOP[Human approval still required]
